---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import schema from "../data/schema/company.json";
---

<Layout
  title="About Flipick: Company, Security & Contact"
  description="About Flipick: a Pune-based learning-technology company founded in 2011. Read our story, security approach and careers, and get in touch with our team."
  keywords="Flipick company, learning technology company Pune, AI video company India, Ravi Dugal Flipick, enterprise learning platform, Flipick about us, contact Flipick"
  page="company"
  schema={schema}
>
  <main>
    <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
    <section class="hero hero--mid" aria-label="About Flipick">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-grid hero-grid--lg">
          <h1 class="hero-h1--md">
            Video should do its job &#8212; <span class="serif-i text-brand-mid"
              >and prove it.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="sub">
            Flipick is a learning-technology company. For <b>15 years</b>,
            Flipick LMS has powered enterprise learning &#8212; and now our AI
            video platform helps teams create, personalize and prove the video
            inside it.
          </p>
          <div class="ways">
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= ABOUT FLIPICK SUMMARY ================= -->
    <section class="section-pad-sm" aria-label="Flipick company overview">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div
          class="fcard rv"
          style="border-left:4px solid var(--brand);padding:1.25rem 1.75rem;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"
        >
          <span class="eyebrow">Flipick — company overview</span>
          <p style="margin-top:.5rem;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7">
            Flipick is an AI video and learning technology company headquartered
            in Pune, India. Founded in 2011, it serves enterprise L&amp;D,
            marketing and customer education teams across manufacturing, retail,
            BFSI, food &amp; beverage, software and healthcare sectors. Flipick
            offers three products: the <strong>AI Video Platform</strong> (create,
            distribute and prove cinematic video, including Variable Video Production);
            <strong>Flipick LMS G2</strong> (AI skills platform with zero-hallucination
            RAG assistant and Singapore Skills Framework integration); and a <strong
              >PowerPoint-to-SCORM pipeline</strong
            >. Customers include Pearson, Godrej, IIBF, Jindal Steel and IFC
            World Bank Group.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= ABOUT / OUR STORY ================= -->
    <section
      id="about"
      class="section-white section-pad-lg"
      aria-label="Our story and milestones"
    >
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head rv">
          <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
          <h2>
            Built on <span class="serif-i text-brand">15 years</span> in learning
            technology.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="lede rv">
          <p>
            Flipick didn't start with AI video &#8212; it started in learning
            technology. Since <b>2011</b>, <b>Flipick LMS</b> has helped enterprises
            deliver, manage and track learning at scale.
          </p>
          <p>
            Working inside those programmes, we kept hearing the same need:
            training and communication had to become <b>video</b> &#8212; studio-grade,
            personalized and measurable &#8212; without the cost and timelines of
            a production house. So we built the Flipick AI video platform on the foundation
            of <b>15 years</b> of learning-technology experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today, the same company that runs your courses can create the video
            inside them, deliver it personally, and prove it landed.
          </p>
          <div class="story-meta">
            <p class="story-meta-name">
              <b>Ravi Dugal</b> &mdash; Founder &amp; CEO &nbsp;<a
                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ravidugal/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="d-none">LinkedIn&nbsp;&rarr;</a>
            </p>
            <p class="story-meta-bio">
              Ravi founded Flipick in 2011 with 20+ years of experience in
              enterprise learning technology, digital publishing and content
              transformation. Under his leadership, Flipick has grown from an
              LMS provider to a full AI video and skills-development platform,
              serving organisations including Pearson, IIBF, Godrej and IFC
              World Bank Group. Based in Pune, India.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="thread rv">
          <div class="node">
            <span class="dot"></span><span class="lbl">Create</span>
          </div><span class="seg"></span>
          <div class="node">
            <span class="dot"></span><span class="lbl">Distribute</span>
          </div><span class="seg"></span>
          <div class="node">
            <span class="dot"></span><span class="lbl">Prove</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Milestone timeline -->
        <div class="rv mt-48">
          <p class="tl-head">Milestones</p>
          <div class="timeline">
            <div class="tl">
              <time class="yr" datetime="2011">2011</time><div class="bd">
                <h4>Flipick Founded</h4><p>
                  Established with a vision to transform education from passive
                  studying to meaningful learning.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tl">
              <time class="yr" datetime="2013">2013</time><div class="bd">
                <h4>Industry Recognition</h4><p>
                  Honored for developing one of the industry's most innovative
                  solutions for automated InDesign-to-ePub conversion.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tl">
              <time class="yr" datetime="2014">2014</time><div class="bd">
                <h4>Launch of Flipick LMS</h4><p>
                  Organizations began delivering, managing, and tracking
                  learning experiences on the Flipick platform.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tl">
              <time class="yr" datetime="2015">2015</time><div class="bd">
                <h4>Leading the Shift from Adobe Flash</h4><p>
                  Introduced tools to migrate and modernize learning content,
                  converting over 500 hours of Adobe Flash content into
                  interactive HTML5 experiences.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tl">
              <time class="yr" datetime="2024">2024</time><div class="bd">
                <h4>Launch of the AI Video Platform</h4><p>
                  Expanded beyond learning management with a studio-grade AI
                  video platform for content creation, personalized delivery,
                  and measurable outcomes.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tl">
              <time class="yr" datetime="2025">2025</time><div class="bd">
                <h4>
                  Flipick LMS G2 &mdash; Next Generation Learning Platform
                </h4><p>
                  Reimagined the LMS with integrated AI capabilities, skills
                  frameworks, and enhanced learner experiences.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tl now">
              <time class="yr" datetime="2026">Today</time><div class="bd">
                <h4>Create &rarr; distribute &rarr; prove</h4><p>
                  An end-to-end AI-powered learning and content
                  ecosystem&mdash;helping organizations create engaging content,
                  deliver it at scale, and demonstrate measurable impact.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vals rv mt-48">
          <div class="val">
            <div class="ic">&#9680;</div><h3>Built by learning people</h3><p>
              Years inside enterprise learning shape everything &#8212;
              structure, measurement, and respect for the learner's time.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="val">
            <div class="ic">&#9678;</div><h3>Proof over impressions</h3><p>
              &#8220;It got views&#8221; isn&#8217;t an outcome. We measure who
              watched, who finished, who acted.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="val">
            <div class="ic">&#25991;</div><h3>Made for many languages</h3><p>
              One production should reach everyone in their own language &#8212;
              without re-recording.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= CONTACT ================= -->
    <section id="contact" class="section-pad-lg" aria-label="Contact Flipick">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head rv">
          <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
          <h2>Let's <span class="serif-i text-brand">talk.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-grid rv">
          <div class="cform">
            <div id="formWrap">
              <h3>Send us a message</h3>
              <p class="fsub">
                Demo, pricing, support or a question &#8212; we reply within a
                business day.
              </p>
              <div class="field two">
                <div>
                  <label for="cName">Name <span class="required">*</span></label
                  >
                  <input
                    type="text"
                    id="cName"
                    placeholder="Your name"
                    autocomplete="name"
                  />
                  <div class="field-error" id="cNameErr"></div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="cEmail"
                    >Work email <span class="required">*</span></label
                  >
                  <input
                    type="email"
                    id="cEmail"
                    placeholder="you@company.com"
                    autocomplete="email"
                  />
                  <div class="field-error" id="cEmailErr"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="field two">
                <div>
                  <label for="cCompany"
                    >Company <span class="required">*</span></label
                  >
                  <input
                    type="text"
                    id="cCompany"
                    placeholder="Company name"
                    autocomplete="organization"
                  />
                  <div class="field-error" id="cCompanyErr"></div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="cTopic"
                    >I'm interested in <span class="required">*</span></label
                  >
                  <select id="cTopic">
                    <option value="">— select a topic —</option>
                    <option value="Booking a demo">Booking a demo</option>
                    <option value="Sales & pricing">Sales &amp; pricing</option>
                    <option value="Support">Support</option>
                    <option value="Partnerships">Partnerships</option>
                    <option value="Careers">Careers</option>
                    <option value="Something else">Something else</option>
                  </select>
                  <div class="field-error" id="cTopicErr"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cMsg">Message <span class="required">*</span></label
                >
                <textarea
                  id="cMsg"
                  placeholder="Tell us a little about what you need..."
                ></textarea>
                <div class="field-error" id="cMsgErr"></div>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary send" id="cSend" disabled>
                <span class="btn-spinner"></span>
                <span class="btn-tri tri"></span>
                <span id="cSendText">Send message</span>
              </button>
              <div class="form-server-error" id="formServerErr"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ok" id="formOk">
              <div class="tick">&#10003;</div>
              <h3>Thanks &#8212; message sent.</h3>
              <p>We&#8217;ve got your note and will be in touch shortly.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="channels">
            <div class="chan">
              <div class="ck">Sales &amp; demos</div>
              <b>Talk to sales</b>
              <p>Pricing, enterprise plans, or a walkthrough.</p>
              <a href="mailto:sales@flipick.com">sales@flipick.com</a>
            </div>
            <div class="chan">
              <div class="ck">Support</div>
              <b>Get help</b>
              <p>Already using Flipick and need a hand?</p>
              <a href="mailto:support@flipick.com">support@flipick.com</a>
            </div>
            <div class="chan">
              <div class="ck">Office</div>
              <b>Pune, India</b>
              <p>Mon&#8211;Fri, 10:00&#8211;18:00 IST</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lms-band d-none">
              <div class="ck">Existing customers</div>
              <b>Looking for Flipick LMS?</b>
              <div class="lms-band-btns">
                <a class="btn btn-primary btn--lms-signin" href="#"
                  >LMS sign in</a
                >
                <a class="btn btn-ghost btn--lms-ghost" href="#">LMS support</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= CLOSING CTA ================= -->
    <!-- ================= FAQ ================= -->
    <section id="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head rv sec-head--center sec-head--mb-md">
          <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
          <h2>
            Common questions about <span class="serif-i text-brand"
              >Flipick.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq rv">
          <details open>
            <summary>Who founded Flipick and where is it based?</summary>
            <p>
              Flipick is a learning-technology company founded in 2011 by Ravi
              Dugal. It is based in Pune, India.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What does Flipick do?</summary>
            <p>
              Flipick builds an AI video platform that creates studio-grade
              video, distributes it personally to every viewer and proves it
              landed. It also offers Flipick LMS, an AI skills-development
              platform, and a PowerPoint-to-SCORM course conversion service.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Who uses Flipick?</summary>
            <p>
              Flipick serves 150,000+ active learners across enterprise clients
              including Pearson, IIBF, Godrej, Jindal Steel, IFC World Bank
              Group and IICA.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How do I contact Flipick?</summary>
            <p>
              Email sales@flipick.com for sales or support@flipick.com for
              support, or book a demo from this page. The Pune office is staffed
              Monday to Friday, 10:00 to 18:00 IST.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing" aria-label="Call to action">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Rather just <span class="serif-i">see it?</span></h2>
        <p>
          Book a demo and we'll take one of your briefs from screenplay to a
          measured campaign.
        </p>
        <div class="ctas-center">
          <a
            class="btn btn-primary"
            data-demo-link
            href="https://calendly.com/amol-chandsarkar/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="tri"></span>Book a demo</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script is:inline slot="scripts" src="/assets/js/form.js"></script>
</Layout>
